%% Authentication and authorization flows
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Staff / customer app
  participant FB as Firebase Auth
  participant API as Backend
  participant DB as MongoDB
  rect rgb(235,245,255)
  note over U,API: Cloud — customer / admin (Firebase)
  U->>FB: phone OTP
  FB-->>U: ID token
  U->>API: POST /auth/firebase-verify or /auth/admin/firebase-login
  API->>FB: verifyIdToken
  API->>DB: find/upsert User (role check)
  API-->>U: JWT (customer 30 d, admin 7 d)
  end
  rect rgb(240,255,240)
  note over U,API: Cloud — employee SMS OTP
  U->>API: POST /auth/employee/send-otp
  API->>DB: active staff by phone
  API-->>U: OTP via Twilio/MSG91 (in-memory, 5 min)
  U->>API: POST /auth/employee/verify-otp
  API-->>U: JWT 7 d {id, role}
  end
  rect rgb(255,245,230)
  note over U,API: LOCAL — device + PIN (O2)
  U->>API: POST /api/local/devices/register (LAN only)
  API-->>U: deviceId + secret; admin approves
  U->>API: POST /api/local/auth/login (phone, PIN, device)
  API->>DB: scrypt+pepper verify, lockout, LocalSession
  API-->>U: JWT with sid
  end
  note over U,API: Every request: protect -> User active -> (LOCAL) session/device valid -> requireRole -> duty gate
